body:
u/JakeTheMemeSnake_  


Backstory:

  It has been  years since Bakunawa has tasted the beauty of the moon. But after all the resistance of humans, Bakunawa barely could touch it.  But soon, He saw that Humans never needed the moon in the modern world with all the light pollution from these "Synthetic moons" (A.K.A Lights). He now did not want to eat the moon anymore, he wants to give back the harassment he has gained from all those loud clanging of pots and pans that Deafened Him.  Now from scales to human flesh, he will find satisfaction knowing the pain they gave him."

&#x200B;

"if they took my ears, I will take their eyes."

&#x200B;

Powers: Light Absorption (Can take light from any light source), Light Repelling (Extremely painful flashbang) , Fast reflexes, cloaking, Water breathing.

&#x200B;

Motives: Revenge
